<h3><u>Nanna sa phool</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Nanna sa phool</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Inkaar Aasman Ko Hai Raazi Zamin Nahin</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>Asghar(a.s.) Teray Lahoo Ka Thikana Kahin Nahin</p>
<p>Maidan Mein Garmi Hai Matti Hai Dhool Hai</p>
<p><br>
Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai, Goya Pisar Ki Laash Say Sibt-e-Rasool Hai, Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai </p>
<ol><li>Asghar(a.s.) Ki Qabr Khood Kar Rotay Raha Hussain</li><p>Kehtay Thay Haaey Lakht-e-Jigar Meray Dil Kay Chain</p><p>Teray Liey Hussain(a.s.) Bohat Dil Malool Hai</p><p>Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai, Goya Pisar Ki Laash Say Sibt-e-Rasool Hai, Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai</p><li>Khaimay Ki Simt Kis Tarha Jaaon Meray Pisar(a.s.)</li><p>Kis Tarha Teray Marg Ki Baano(s.a.) Ko Doon Khabar</p><p>Us Ko Teray Baghair To Marna Qubool Hai</p><p>Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai, Goya Pisar Ki Laash Say Sibt-e-Rasool Hai, Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai</p><li>Ab Hum(a.s.) Bhi Marnay Jaatay Hain Aey Laal(a.s.) Alwidaa</li><p>Laasha Hamara Hona Hai Pamaal Alwidaa</p><p>Bach Jaey Deen Nana Ka Mehnat Wusool Hai</p><p>Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai, Goya Pisar Ki Laash Say Sibt-e-Rasool Hai, Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai</p><li>Laasha Hai Us Kay Haat Peh Khoon Mein Bhara Hua</li><p>Jisko Lab-e-Furaat Bhi Pani Na Mil Saka</p><p>Jis Kay Liey Rasool Kay Sajday Ko Tool Hai</p><p>Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai, Goya Pisar Ki Laash Say Sibt-e-Rasool Hai, Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai</p><li>Aey Fauj-e-Kibria(a.s.) Kay Mujahid(a.s.) Tujhay Salam</li><p>Kia Shaan-e-Be Zubani Say Tu Nay Kia Kalam </p><p>Tareekh-e-Guftugu Ka Anokha Usool Hai</p><p>Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai, Goya Pisar Ki Laash Say Sibt-e-Rasool Hai, Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai</p><li>Zakhmi Tera Gala Hai Lahoo Phool Sa Badan</li></ol>

<p>Khaimay Kay Dar Peh Baali Sakina(s.a.) Teri Behan(s.a.)</p>
<p>Kehti Hai Teray Baad Ghumon Ka Nuzool Hai</p>
<p>Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai, Goya Pisar Ki Laash Say Sibt-e-Rasool Hai, Jalti Hai Yeh Zamin Tu Nanha Sa Phool Hai</p></font></p>
